WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:05.960
Xuan Kingdom's people suffer this calamity if I avoid battle.

00:06.800 --> 00:08.467
Then hearts will turn away.

00:09.920 --> 00:11.320
Xie Xuan, receive orders.

00:11.880 --> 00:17.640
Your general is here muster troops and attack cover the people entering the city orders received.

00:18.160 --> 00:20.960
Your Highness follow military orders.

00:22.360 --> 00:23.760
Yes.

00:27.840 --> 00:32.320
Xie's army charges into the enemy formation successfully scatters the Wuzhao's supervision team.

00:32.600 --> 00:37.120
But is also tightly engaged by the prepared Wuzhao army that was waiting.

00:37.680 --> 00:43.200
Shilang takes advantage to launch a strong attack you personally lead troops in a desperate defense buying time for the people.

00:43.280 --> 00:44.720
To escape.

00:50.760 --> 00:53.960
A day later Yiyang falls.

00:58.080 --> 00:59.480
You're a real man.

01:01.000 --> 01:03.000
I'll give you a quick death.

